  {
    "id": 2009009110010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "おはようございますっ！　プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030090040",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう果穂、今日は随分早いんだな\r\n中学校からそのまま来たのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　期末試験が終わったので\r\n早く身体を動かしたくって！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "期間中は勉強漬けだったもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "部活もお休みでしたし、 \r\nレッスンも減らしてたので、寂しかったです",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その分、今日からはしっかりレッスンを入れてあるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ありがとうございますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110050,
    "speaker": "テレビの音声",
    "text": "『あたし、これからも……』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ！　そのドラマっ！ \r\n懐かしいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、昨日買った雑誌でこの話題が載っててな\r\nちょっと見たくなったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110061,
    "speaker": "テレビの音声",
    "text": "『あなたと、ずっと一緒に……』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110061"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110062,
    "speaker": "テレビの音声",
    "text": "『えへへっ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110062"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ラストの果穂の表情、ホントによかったよな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こういう仕事、もっと取ってきたいよな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分の得意分野とか好きなことを\r\n活かせるって、すごくいいことだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう仕事なら、果穂の成長を\r\n今よりもっともっと促せるんじゃないかって思ったんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ありがとうございますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんはやっぱりスゴいですね\r\nいつでもしっかりと考えてます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなことないよ\r\n前も言ったように、俺は自分をすごいなんて思えない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、本当にすごかったら\r\nさっき言ったみたいな仕事、もっと取ってこれてるし──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "！　それは違いますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あのお仕事をくれた\r\nプロデューサーさんは本当にスゴいんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "『あなたと、ずっと一緒に……』",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、あのセリフ、大好きなんです！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "主人公を支えたいっていう気持ち",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "主人公と歩んでいきたいっていう気持ち",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "思い返す度に小学生の時にはわからなかったことが\r\nわかってきて、心に浮かびます",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんと一緒なら\r\nこういう体験がまだまだできると思うんですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、ずっと一緒にプロデューサーさんと\r\nアイドルしていきたいんですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
