  {
    "id": 2009009110220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "おはようございますっ！　プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "009",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "009",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あれっプロデューサーさん……？\r\nもしかして本当に『おはよう』ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……どうやら少しだけうとうとしていたみたいだ……\r\n何か夢を見ていた気がするけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110240,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんはおつかれですね！\r\nもうちょっと休んでいて……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110250,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "！　プロデューサーさんの机にあるの……\r\nそれ……紙袋ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、そうだ！　この間のドラマの完パケが届いてな\r\n果穂が来たらすぐに一緒に観ようと思っていたんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110260,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わあっ！　あたし、\r\n完パケが届くのずっと待ってました……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よしっ、待ってろ\r\n今すぐ再生するから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あ、さっきの夢を思い出した\r\n中学生になった果穂の夢だったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110270,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっ……！　あたしの夢……！\r\nど、どんなふうになっていましたかっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009110280,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ちゃんと大人っぽいあたし……でしたかっ……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900911/2009009110280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……そうだなぁ……えっと…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……口で説明するより、\r\nドラマを観てもらった方が早そうだ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──いくぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
